sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Raft as Raft Leader FSM
    participant Hook as Audit Hook / Producer
    participant Queue as Bounded In-Memory Queue (Buffer)
    participant Worker as Background Batch Flusher
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Raft: Command Committed to Quorum
    Raft->>Hook: EmitAuditEvent(eventType, resource, owner, token)
    Hook->>Queue: Non-blocking enqueue (Drop oldest or ring-buffer on overflow)
    
    loop Every flush_interval (e.g. 100ms) or max_batch_size (e.g. 50 events)
        Worker->>Queue: Dequeue batch of audit events
        alt Database Online
            Worker->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            Worker->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_events (batch of rows)
            DB-->>Worker: COMMIT SUCCESS
        else Database Degraded / Unreachable
            Worker->>Worker: Log error, retain failed batch in bounded retry buffer
            Worker->>Worker: Exponential backoff with jitter
            Note over Worker: Core Raft operations continue unaffected (Best-effort audit buffering)
        end
    end

